@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@adminToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_ADMIN
@userId = THAY_BANG_GUID_TAI_KHOAN

### 1. Danh sach tai khoan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Tim kiem tai khoan theo ten/email/so dien thoai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?keyword=nguyen&isActive=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Xem chi tiet tai khoan (khong tra PasswordHash)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Khoa tai khoan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 5. Mo khoa tai khoan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Cap nhat vai tro
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["Tenant"]
}

### 7. Gan nhieu vai tro neu nghiep vu cho phep
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["Tenant", "Landlord"]
}

### Kiem thu phan quyen
# Thu lai cac request tren bang JWT Tenant/Landlord: phai nhan 403.
# Thu khoa tai khoan hoac thay doi role, sau do goi API bang JWT cu: token phai bi tu choi.
# Khong duoc tu khoa minh, tu thay doi role, hoac khoa/go Admin cua Admin cuoi cung.
